<title>ITALY: Fondiaria '96 Italian premium income up.</title>
<headline>Fondiaria '96 Italian premium income up.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ending December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(In billion lire unless stated, preliminary)</p>
<p>    Italian premium income    2,225   (up 5.3 pct)</p>
<p>of which</p>
<p>    Life premium income	   467   (up 6.0 pct)</p>
<p>    Non-life premium income   1,788   (up 5.1 pct)</p>
<p>    Cons premiums		 6,000   (up 5.5 pct)</p>
<p>    Total life premiums	  n/a    (up 9.6 pct)</p>
<p>Note - La Fondiaria Assicurazioni gave no profit figure but said the profit was in line with the preceding year's profit, which was 87.6 billion lire.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129450</p>
</text>
